{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tokyo Hotel</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a young man stepping into the vibrant city of Tokyo, you soon discover what the world already whispers about: Japanese women are renowned for their fiery passion and irresistible allure, especially when it comes to adventurous strangers. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902390/extras/07a483fcdfbd0f826b4092bf2a9fbbe5.poster.avif?t=1760719177\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902390/extras/07a483fcdfbd0f826b4092bf2a9fbbe5.webm?t=1760719177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902390/extras/07a483fcdfbd0f826b4092bf2a9fbbe5.mp4?t=1760719177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>From quiet students with a hidden wild side to elegant office ladies craving release after long workdays, every woman you meet has her own desires, secrets, and fantasies waiting to be uncovered.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902390/extras/d540ec90582b33d21a19898862f661db.poster.avif?t=1760719177\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902390/extras/d540ec90582b33d21a19898862f661db.webm?t=1760719177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902390/extras/d540ec90582b33d21a19898862f661db.mp4?t=1760719177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Welcome to <i>Tokyo Hotel</i> \u2014 a sensual visual novel that takes you deep into the neon-lit heart of Japan\u2019s capital, where temptation hides behind every corner and every encounter can turn into something unforgettable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902390/extras/3d5224d2783dd57a2508f7fbcfbfd91e.poster.avif?t=1760719177\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902390/extras/3d5224d2783dd57a2508f7fbcfbfd91e.webm?t=1760719177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902390/extras/3d5224d2783dd57a2508f7fbcfbfd91e.mp4?t=1760719177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seduce, romance, and indulge in nights you\u2019ll never forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902390/extras/d000b2a08e1fa9da8fa07616d52f144b.poster.avif?t=1760719177\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902390/extras/d000b2a08e1fa9da8fa07616d52f144b.webm?t=1760719177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902390/extras/d000b2a08e1fa9da8fa07616d52f144b.mp4?t=1760719177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A sensual story set in modern-day Tokyo</strong> \u2014 experience the thrill of seducing passionate Japanese women in the city that never sleeps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple heroines to pursue</strong> \u2014 each girl has her own unique personality, backstory, and secret desires.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive choices</strong> \u2014 your decisions open different dialogs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-qualit